# spec-integrator cache & reports
# .spec-integrator/doc_cache.db is committed: it's the actual LLM-audit
# evidence (risk assessments, judge verdicts) the Obligation Gate reads, not
# a derived report like doc_report.md/doc_graph.json. Ignoring it meant a
# fresh checkout (or CI, which never runs an LLM audit) could never see a
# real judge verdict, so any {VERIFY_LLM}-tagged document would fail
# OBLIG-JUDGE-MISSING regardless of whether the audit had ever actually run.
doc_report.md
doc_graph.json

